WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:01.291
Listen up, gentlemen.

00:00:01.291 --> 00:00:03.833
You morons may have only let me win 11 games.

00:00:03.833 --> 00:00:04.833
We suck. We're...

00:00:04.833 --> 00:00:05.958
NOT GETTING MINNESOTA MIRACLE’D

00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:07.208
BY THE F--KING EAGLES THIS—

00:00:07.208 --> 00:00:08.875
year may be Jared’s last chance

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:09.750
before we replace him

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:10.958
with another cheap rookie.

00:00:10.958 --> 00:00:11.666
I’m sorry, what?

00:00:11.666 --> 00:00:13.666
I SAID I DON’T EVEN LOOK WHEN I THROW.

00:00:13.666 --> 00:00:14.458
WOO-HOO! YEAH!

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:17.583
Settle down

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:18.458
I know everyone is depressed

00:00:18.458 --> 00:00:19.666
because we’re a two seed

00:00:19.666 --> 00:00:20.875
but we have to stick together.

00:00:20.875 --> 00:00:21.291
Gilmore

00:00:21.291 --> 00:00:22.041
what happens when we're

00:00:22.041 --> 00:00:23.416
five seconds late to a meeting?

00:00:23.416 --> 00:00:25.000
We get yelled at till we cry?

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:25.583
And Gronk

00:00:25.583 --> 00:00:26.333
remember when you were

00:00:26.333 --> 00:00:27.416
unhappy with the team?

00:00:27.416 --> 00:00:28.791
PATRIOTS TRIED TO TRADE GRONK

00:00:28.791 --> 00:00:30.250
AFTER THEY BROKE GRONK’S BODY.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.958
And Josh Gordon, remem-

00:00:31.958 --> 00:00:33.583
 Oh right. We have no—

00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:35.083
RECEIVERS MUST GET TACKLED

00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:36.291
ON THE LAST PLAY OF THE—

00:00:36.291 --> 00:00:37.166
game reminds me of the

00:00:37.166 --> 00:00:40.208
1918 Dayton Triangles/Toledo Maroons game

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.166
where they had a secret—

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:41.791
weapon.

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:44.041
ANDY REID AFTER A BYE WEEK!!!

00:00:44.041 --> 00:00:45.625
I HAVE TIME, BOYS!

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:46.333
HE’S BACK!

00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:46.750
And yes

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:47.791
there’s stuff to worry about

00:00:47.791 --> 00:00:48.750
like aging—

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:49.625
And Zeke

00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:50.291
And the fact that

00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:51.791
Bountygate clearly angered God

00:00:51.791 --> 00:00:53.416
AND HURTING MY FRIEND THE FOOTBALL

00:00:53.416 --> 00:00:54.958
BY THROWING IT TOO HARD.

00:00:54.958 --> 00:00:56.333
BUT THIS IS OUR YEAR.

00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:58.583
BIG NICK HERE TO DOUBLE DOINK EVERYONE!

00:00:58.583 --> 00:01:00.000
- Oh Christ!
- Oh Muskrats!

